    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d912">

                <pb facs="0973" n="1807" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp01v02/pg1807"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72111/6938</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stovall</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-04-19T16:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 19, 1918, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1773. Your 3075, April 13, 5 p.m. Department not prepared to have Legation
                    associate itself with the Allied legations in note to Swiss Government without
                    facts as to incidents making note desirable. See stipulations of article 7,
                    treaty of 1850 with Switzerland.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
